{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224100","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1322410001:1":{"text":"To follow the Great Will is to escape this wretched, rotting world...","source_cn":"只要聆听到伟大意志的指引，就可以摆脱这污浊绝望的世界……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35FC1F29BA6871A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322410002:1":{"text":"\"Wretched\"? \"Rotting\"? You were living just fine in Cedartown—food, shelter, warm bed. What more do you want?","source_cn":"污浊绝望？可是……你们在雪松镇的时候也都是能够吃饱穿暖的啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9C8E1BF003235EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322410003:1":{"text":"Doubt is poison...","source_cn":"反对的声音，也是污秽……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A360CBE1A0D56F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322410004:1":{"text":"Words spoken against the faith... they taint the soul... corrupt the mind...","source_cn":"信仰之外的言辞只会让我心生杂念……口吐浊气……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB97A841D88203A13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322410005:1":{"text":"It's no use, Chippy. Let's just get them back to town first.","source_cn":"没用的，满满。只能先这样把他们带回镇子里了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE662A14CAF6FF332","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322410006:1":{"text":"Ah! The Great Will has shown itself! Follow me!","source_cn":"啊！我看到伟大意志了，跟上我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39BAB14C9C14B586","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322410007:1":{"text":"It's you... You finally found me! Praise be to the one true god! I'm coming!","source_cn":"是您……您终于找到我了！赞美唯一的真神！我这就来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB93C6125FE23B094","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:镇民奥莉佳":{"text":"Citizen Ophelia","source":"镇民奥莉佳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}